Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.98,0:00:04.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Now everybody lift your hands up!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.28,0:00:06.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Sing about what you are dreaming!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.38,0:00:07.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Always stand up!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.94,0:00:09.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Raise up the flag that can't be beaten!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.00,0:00:11.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Gotta keep up!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.60,0:00:15.68,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll get past every wall that's\Nin our wake, go without hesitation!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.76,0:00:16.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Hands up!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.86,0:00:26.62,Default,,0,0,0,,We just have to press on a little more.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.70,0:00:30.20,Default,,0,0,0,,To get to the answers we're looking for.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.28,0:00:34.90,Default,,0,0,0,,We came to this new world\Nbelieving that surely someday.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.98,0:00:37.96,Default,,0,0,0,,We just might find the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.04,0:00:42.90,Default,,0,0,0,,All the pieces of our dreams\Nhave now come together.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.98,0:00:45.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Our bonds won't waver.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.44,0:00:47.84,Default,,0,0,0,,With our dreaming hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.92,0:00:49.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's head on towards.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.66,0:00:52.70,Default,,0,0,0,,A bright new future.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.78,0:00:56.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Now everybody lift your hands up.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.62,0:00:58.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Sing about what you are dreaming.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.68,0:01:00.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Always stand up.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.30,0:01:02.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Raise up the flag that you believe in.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.48,0:01:03.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Gotta keep up.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.04,0:01:06.32,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll get past everyone that's in our way.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.40,0:01:08.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's head on never stopping.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.68,0:01:11.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Only look up.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.42,0:01:13.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep your head up way up high.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.42,0:01:15.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Always step up.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.12,0:01:17.02,Default,,0,0,0,,If waves are rough, jump to the sky.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.10,0:01:18.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Never give up.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.88,0:01:20.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Our wishes, they will come together.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.86,0:01:23.20,Default,,0,0,0,,And lead us on for the future.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.66,0:01:27.84,Default,,0,0,0,,We drift on riding the waves.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.92,0:01:30.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Towards another shore day by day.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.80,0:01:35.50,Default,,0,0,0,,There are many meetings, many goodbyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.58,0:01:37.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Underneath the flag we fly.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.06,0:01:43.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll remember the pain within.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.78,0:01:45.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll keep it in my heart forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.94,0:01:47.98,Default,,0,0,0,,And never take it lightly.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.06,0:01:49.84,Default,,0,0,0,,But I won't surrender.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.92,0:01:52.04,Default,,0,0,0,,This freedom I will keep in mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.12,0:01:54.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll keep holding on, never stop it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.74,0:01:57.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Now everybody lift your hands up.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.52,0:01:59.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Sing about what you are dreaming.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.60,0:02:01.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Always stand up.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.26,0:02:03.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Raise up the flag that you believe in.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.42,0:02:04.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Gotta keep up.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.96,0:02:07.24,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll get past everyone that's in our way.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.32,0:02:09.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's head on, never stop it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.88,0:02:14.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Only look up, keep your\Nhead up, way up high.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.34,0:02:17.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Always step up, if brains\Nare rough, jump to the sky.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.04,0:02:21.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Never give up, our wishes,\Nthey will come together.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.76,0:02:24.14,Default,,0,0,0,,And lead us on for the future.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.00,0:02:26.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Hands up.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.22,0:02:32.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Momonosuke?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.24,0:02:34.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Indeed, that is my name
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.90,0:02:39.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I swear I've heard that somewhere\Nbefore That's really gonna
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.86,0:02:43.82,Default,,0,0,0,,bug me I can assure you we've\Nnever met before But that aside,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.06,0:02:45.16,Default,,0,0,0,,stop staring
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.36,0:02:48.80,Default,,0,0,0,,And don't drool
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.56,0:02:54.52,Default,,0,0,0,,You will never make a\Nsnack out of me If you try,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.72,0:02:57.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I will swallow you whole Please step away
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.34,0:03:08.20,Default,,0,0,0,,are you stuck on this thing somewhere\Nyou're talking with your farts right
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.28,0:03:12.98,Default,,0,0,0,,hey hello what have you lost your mind
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.06,0:03:15.98,Default,,0,0,0,,you're not a dragon you're a talking eel
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.38,0:03:20.50,Default,,0,0,0,,wipe away that drool i am not an eel
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.40,0:03:27.58,Default,,0,0,0,,looks like we're both hungry huh
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.70,0:03:33.06,Default,,0,0,0,,don't be absurd I am a\Nproud samurai warrior
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.14,0:03:36.84,Default,,0,0,0,,ten days of fasting is nothing to me tell
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.92,0:03:40.42,Default,,0,0,0,,me who are you and why are you here oh me
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.50,0:03:43.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Lucy I'm gonna be king\Nof the pirates someday
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.96,0:03:54.52,Default,,0,0,0,,that's a joke pirates are all white of\Ngirth quite tall in stature hairy and Crude,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.66,0:03:57.96,Default,,0,0,0,,their king, would surely smell\Nmuch worse than you as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.04,0:03:59.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Anyway, can you get me out?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.92,0:04:00.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, eel.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.24,0:04:02.26,Default,,0,0,0,,This is your home, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.34,0:04:03.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Her name's Momonosuke!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.66,0:04:06.49,Default,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.80,0:04:08.92,Default,,0,0,0,,So you must not be from here either.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.22,0:04:10.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I am an outsider as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.24,0:04:15.01,Default,,0,0,0,,I only know that sick children\Nhave been gathered in this place.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.00,0:04:20.71,Default,,0,0,0,,I know not what manner of island this is,\Nnor what strange fate has befallen me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.86,0:04:24.96,Default,,0,0,0,,My misfortune began when I was discovered
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.04,0:04:27.63,Default,,0,0,0,,as a stowaway on a\Nsea-faring vessel nearby.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.96,0:04:32.86,Default,,0,0,0,,At first, I tried to distance\Nmyself from the other children here.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.10,0:04:36.69,Default,,0,0,0,,But they were so kind, and they\Nwere quite insistent as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.28,0:04:40.69,Default,,0,0,0,,They're giving out food.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.94,0:04:42.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Aren't you hungry?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.26,0:04:44.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Heed this!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.26,0:04:45.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I am a samurai!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.54,0:04:47.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I do not accept alms or pity!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.58,0:04:51.99,Default,,0,0,0,,I was terribly stressed.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.44,0:04:54.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I do regret my brusqueness.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.46,0:04:55.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't be shy.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.68,0:04:56.70,Default,,0,0,0,,We've got plenty.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.06,0:04:59.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I told you I don't want any, didn't I?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.14,0:05:01.91,Default,,0,0,0,,But you have to eat something.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.04,0:05:04.80,Default,,0,0,0,,We're all separated from our parents,\Nso we have to stick together.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.88,0:05:06.35,Default,,0,0,0,,My turmoil is mine alone!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.58,0:05:08.24,Default,,0,0,0,,You do not know how I feel!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.52,0:05:10.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Hello, children.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.88,0:05:12.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I am Master Caesar.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.74,0:05:16.18,Default,,0,0,0,,This room is all yours,\Nand as long as you're here,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.46,0:05:18.58,Default,,0,0,0,,we'll take very special care of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.36,0:05:20.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.22,0:05:22.42,Default,,0,0,0,,What's your name, kid?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.50,0:05:24.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I have none for the likes of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.68,0:05:27.60,Default,,0,0,0,,You hungry?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.82,0:05:30.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Here, have a snack.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.86,0:05:35.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't want it. Candy? Go away!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.86,0:05:39.66,Default,,0,0,0,,So you're telling me one\Nof the children ran away?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.74,0:05:40.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, but it's weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.20,0:05:43.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone on the boarding\Nlist is accounted for.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.42,0:05:44.25,Default,,0,0,0,,That is weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.48,0:05:45.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Doesn't matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.50,0:05:47.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's just split up and find them quick.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.32,0:06:16.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, you!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.72,0:06:22.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Momonosuke?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.63,0:06:23.87,Default,,0,0,0,,That's an interesting name.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.76,0:06:26.18,Default,,0,0,0,,This is a secret room.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.40,0:06:27.70,Default,,0,0,0,,It's bad to come here.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.14,0:06:30.74,Default,,0,0,0,,You need not involve\Nyourself with me any further.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.82,0:06:31.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Please go away.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.30,0:06:35.10,Default,,0,0,0,,You cannot be my friend\Nbecause... because I...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.18,0:06:37.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I am going to escape this place.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.68,0:06:40.52,Default,,0,0,0,,It's sad, but we all know how you feel.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.80,0:06:42.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Because we are the same way.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.12,0:06:46.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone wants to see their family.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.66,0:06:48.36,Default,,0,0,0,,We all want to go home soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.56,0:06:53.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Even though we all came from\Ndifferent islands, we're friends now.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.76,0:06:56.32,Default,,0,0,0,,And hey, we'll all get better, I'm sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.18,0:07:01.65,Default,,0,0,0,,In the meantime, even if we miss our\Nparents, it's not so bad if you ask me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.92,0:07:03.68,Default,,0,0,0,,The biscuit room is so fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.80,0:07:05.94,Default,,0,0,0,,And we still have each\Nother to count on, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.02,0:07:07.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Come back, have something to eat.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.20,0:07:12.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Do that, and I'm sure you're going to\Nfeel much better in no time, Momonosuke.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.52,0:07:13.84,Default,,0,0,0,,But I, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.92,0:07:16.10,Default,,0,0,0,,This door isn't supposed to be open.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.44,0:07:26.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Somebody in here?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.16,0:07:29.20,Default,,0,0,0,,That's weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.78,0:07:47.34,Default,,0,0,0,,What did we walk into? No clue.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.82,0:07:49.94,Default,,0,0,0,,What happened to Momonosuke?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.34,0:07:53.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I think they were storing some\Nweird Devil Fruit in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.54,0:07:54.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Dr.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.45,0:07:55.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Vegabum tried creating one himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.46,0:07:58.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I heard it was a failure, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.66,0:08:00.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Me too, but he made something here.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.62,0:08:12.90,Default,,0,0,0,,So, I was a human, once at least.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.84,0:08:16.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.00,0:08:18.47,Default,,0,0,0,,So you ate a Devil Fruit?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.58,0:08:19.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, no biggie.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.74,0:08:23.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Why don't you just use your\Npower to turn back to normal?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.08,0:08:23.91,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.99,0:08:25.38,Default,,0,0,0,,It's really that simple?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.56,0:08:26.52,Default,,0,0,0,,So I can do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.60,0:08:27.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Teach me how!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.90,0:08:30.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry. I can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.64,0:08:32.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't have Snow powers, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.34,0:08:34.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Man, I can't even see\Nthe hole I fell through.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.92,0:08:37.33,Default,,0,0,0,,How high does that ceiling go up, anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.32,0:08:40.67,Default,,0,0,0,,I am eager to escape this place as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.82,0:08:43.35,Default,,0,0,0,,The children must be\Ninformed of the truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.92,0:08:45.51,Default,,0,0,0,,I heard something dreadful.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.78,0:08:48.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Caesar, he unwittingly\Nrevealed a dark secret.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.58,0:09:01.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, the children are quite obedient.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.66,0:09:07.84,Default,,0,0,0,,They're enlarging with no\Nparticular side effects.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.62,0:09:09.48,Default,,0,0,0,,But of course,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.68,0:09:12.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't expect that to last\Nlong since the purpose of
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.28,0:09:15.40,Default,,0,0,0,,this experiment is to test\Nthe limits of dosage size.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.88,0:09:21.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, at any rate, I'm sure they'll\Nall die off in about five years or so.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.62,0:09:27.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Hopefully no one will catch on\Nand we can bring in a new batch.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.96,0:09:34.46,Default,,0,0,0,,That man's kindness is\Nnothing but a facade.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.54,0:09:39.16,Default,,0,0,0,,He will drive those children to an early\Ngrave without even an ounce of regret,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.24,0:09:40.54,Default,,0,0,0,,and they know nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.16,0:09:42.00,Default,,0,0,0,,In truth,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.24,0:09:44.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I was already on my way to warn\Nthem of their present danger,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.06,0:09:48.94,Default,,0,0,0,,but when I hid in a trash can, I\Nfell down to this wretched place.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.16,0:09:51.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Caesar!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.70,0:09:55.78,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, Momo.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.28,0:09:58.40,Default,,0,0,0,,We're wasting too much time in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.62,0:10:00.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm getting us out. How?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.80,0:10:03.80,Default,,0,0,0,,You remarked yourself on\Nthe height of the ceiling.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.40,0:10:05.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna climb.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.68,0:10:07.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold on to my back.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.64,0:10:11.66,Default,,0,0,0,,And don't worry about the\Nkids. They'll be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.30,0:10:14.71,Default,,0,0,0,,My friends are on their way to help them.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.08,0:10:16.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that true?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.72,0:10:19.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, and they always keep their word.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.56,0:10:21.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Just worry about yourself for now.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.88,0:10:25.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.88,0:10:27.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I was right after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.78,0:10:30.74,Default,,0,0,0,,You are no lonely pirate, but a valiant.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.14,0:10:38.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Momo, do you need food?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.38,0:10:39.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, buddy, get up.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.04,0:10:41.98,Default,,0,0,0,,You gotta pull it together, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.10,0:10:43.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Pull it together.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.12,0:10:45.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Pull it together.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.14,0:10:54.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.64,0:10:55.98,Default,,0,0,0,,So you can fly.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.34,0:11:07.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I hope Nami's team's\Ndoing okay without me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.94,0:11:12.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean, they got Zoro, but\Nhe's no Usopp. Hey, Brook!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.96,0:11:15.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Look around for some\NC-PRISM stone handcuffs!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.70,0:11:17.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Robin's ever gonna need them!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.34,0:11:18.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Just count on me!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.60,0:11:21.06,Default,,0,0,0,,One Samurai-san and a\Nfew pair of handcuffs.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.14,0:11:23.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I would imagine both of them\Nmust be somewhere close by.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.98,0:11:26.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's just slip through this wall first.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.78,0:11:34.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Shit!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.88,0:11:53.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Everybody, this way!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.56,0:11:55.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Just a little bit more!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.26,0:11:57.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Head straight into the biscuit room!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.84,0:12:00.25,Default,,0,0,0,,That's all it's getting!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.32,0:12:02.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop complaining!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.62,0:12:04.12,Default,,0,0,0,,We're trying our best!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.58,0:12:05.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, try harder, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.30,0:12:08.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Get your ass to the biscuit room now!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.58,0:12:10.36,Default,,0,0,0,,We've got some kids to save!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.66,0:12:14.60,Default,,0,0,0,,It's cold!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.82,0:12:16.48,Default,,0,0,0,,This whole room is a blizzard!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.56,0:12:20.06,Default,,0,0,0,,As soon as I take my coat off,\Nthat burp woman makes it slow!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.14,0:12:21.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I am gonna choke her!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.98,0:12:22.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.89,0:12:25.28,Default,,0,0,0,,You guys can't eat that\Ncandy no matter what!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.56,0:12:27.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Run away, Mocha! Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.74,0:12:29.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Just give us the candy!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.14,0:12:31.24,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't run forever, you know!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.46,0:12:32.32,Default,,0,0,0,,You're crazy!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.68,0:12:34.24,Default,,0,0,0,,All of this just for candy?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.32,0:12:36.02,Default,,0,0,0,,You just want it for yourself!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.10,0:12:37.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't be greedy!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.50,0:12:40.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Perhaps I can slow them down.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.54,0:12:43.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd rather you not.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.88,0:12:45.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Open!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.08,0:12:59.90,Default,,0,0,0,,You three, do something\Nto stop those kids.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.24,0:13:01.71,Default,,0,0,0,,You're a Logia type, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.46,0:13:03.44,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.84,0:13:04.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Bring it on.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.14,0:13:09.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Calvin. Are you OK?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.04,0:13:10.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.24,0:13:12.53,Default,,0,0,0,,It was only a scratch.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.72,0:13:14.88,Default,,0,0,0,,But we had better hurry\Nand stop the children.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.96,0:13:15.79,Default,,0,0,0,,You're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.87,0:13:17.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh no, they're leaving!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.40,0:13:19.18,Default,,0,0,0,,We can't let the kids get away!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.26,0:13:20.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, Mocha!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.64,0:13:23.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I promised Mocha I would hold them\Noff so she could get a head start,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.92,0:13:25.57,Default,,0,0,0,,but this has all gone wrong!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.76,0:13:27.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I put her in danger!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.08,0:13:30.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Look at that candy!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.82,0:13:33.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, guys!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.18,0:13:35.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Now the choppers tell\Nme what this stuff does!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.32,0:13:38.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't let you have it!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.58,0:13:41.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Why can't you see that\Nthis candy's hurting you?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.16,0:13:43.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Just look what it's making you do!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.02,0:13:50.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Mock, we just don't have any choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.32,0:13:53.40,Default,,0,0,0,,They said we were both really sick.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.34,0:13:57.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Mommy! Daddy!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.26,0:14:01.73,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, but you can't see them anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.00,0:14:03.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I still wish I could have said goodbye,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.90,0:14:07.14,Default,,0,0,0,,but I don't want anything\Nbad to happen to our parents.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.20,0:14:09.32,Default,,0,0,0,,But it's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.90,0:14:13.08,Default,,0,0,0,,They said we'd be better in\Na year, so let's be brave.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.06,0:14:15.98,Default,,0,0,0,,You have no reason to fear.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.34,0:14:20.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Whatever it takes, I promise I'll\Nhave all of you sweet children
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.94,0:14:25.34,Default,,0,0,0,,feeling better in no time.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.42,0:14:30.00,Default,,0,0,0,,The truth is, I lost my only\Nson to this deadly disease.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.36,0:14:32.56,Default,,0,0,0,,It broke my heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.64,0:14:37.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll do everything in my power to ensure\Nno child ever suffers from It again,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.80,0:14:43.70,Default,,0,0,0,,and I can't bear to see another\Nparent bury their precious child.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.78,0:14:45.00,Default,,0,0,0,,The way I had to.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.32,0:14:50.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, I'm sorry, please excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.30,0:14:52.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I, I shouldn't cry in front of you?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.70,0:14:55.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you okay, poor master!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.22,0:14:58.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you, dear, so kind of you to ask.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.40,0:15:02.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, anyway, I suppose I should\Nintroduce you to everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.16,0:15:06.80,Default,,0,0,0,,These children come from different islands,\Nbut they all share the same ailment.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.88,0:15:07.71,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm Uzu.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.79,0:15:08.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Nice to meet you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.78,0:15:10.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Candy!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.92,0:15:14.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Hi, I'm Dolan.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.88,0:15:15.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Come back!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.68,0:15:17.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, God!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.64,0:15:20.28,Default,,0,0,0,,My name's Gonbe.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.60,0:15:22.38,Default,,0,0,0,,We need more candy!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.24,0:15:29.42,Default,,0,0,0,,We've got some new friends\Njoining us today, children.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.00,0:15:31.22,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, kids.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.50,0:15:32.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Be sure to play nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.18,0:15:35.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, and let me know if\Nyou need any help, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.36,0:15:36.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.54,0:15:37.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks for days!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.88,0:15:42.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Lone seemed so nice, but she tricked us!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.08,0:15:46.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Everything she told us was a lie!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.40,0:15:48.66,Default,,0,0,0,,You handled your treatment so well.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.50,0:15:50.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Have this.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.74,0:15:52.98,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a piece of candy from the Master.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.18,0:15:55.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Guys, we gotta get out of here!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.22,0:15:56.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry up!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.56,0:15:58.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, step out of it!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.76,0:16:05.18,Default,,0,0,0,,We have to catch up with\Nthe children, and quick!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.26,0:16:06.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.30,0:16:09.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey! Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.28,0:16:12.57,Default,,0,0,0,,You really think you can just run away?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.86,0:16:14.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Saru, what are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.14,0:16:16.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you dare try to get me!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.26,0:16:18.61,Default,,0,0,0,,What is wrong with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.84,0:16:20.84,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't just use me as a shield!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.22,0:16:26.16,Default,,0,0,0,,That's too bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.90,0:16:28.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are you attacking them?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.46,0:16:29.93,Default,,0,0,0,,They're no threat to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.12,0:16:35.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Get out of the way, Zoro.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.94,0:16:39.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Heat egg!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.64,0:16:45.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I figured melting her would work.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.84,0:16:48.32,Default,,0,0,0,,There's more where that\Ncame from, BirdBrain!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.40,0:16:50.72,Default,,0,0,0,,So she's the one worth 16 million.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.12,0:16:55.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, enough hiding in the snow!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.16,0:16:59.34,Default,,0,0,0,,You want to finish this or\Nnot, you oversized chicken?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.68,0:17:01.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Look at the door! What's happening?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.92,0:17:04.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Snow fence.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.30,0:17:07.13,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.86,0:17:08.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Nami, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.80,0:17:12.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't move!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.30,0:17:13.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm freezing up!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.88,0:17:19.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Not again!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.46,0:17:20.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't let her get you!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.24,0:17:26.42,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, Katorea Manos!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.12,0:17:27.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Face!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.14,0:17:34.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Mommy!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.00,0:17:38.76,Default,,0,0,0,,She's so scary!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.54,0:17:44.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, but Master Caesar needs those\Ntest subjects for an important project.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.44,0:17:49.90,Default,,0,0,0,,That's why it's my job, to ensure\Nhe and the experiment are kept safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.96,0:17:54.94,Default,,0,0,0,,But now you've given Mocha\Nthese rebellious ideas. Us!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.20,0:17:58.52,Default,,0,0,0,,They chose to leave this awful\Nplace of their own free will!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.60,0:17:59.43,Default,,0,0,0,,That's enough!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.51,0:18:00.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Out of my way!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.78,0:18:05.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Go on, hurry up!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.78,0:18:08.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Follow me! Right!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.80,0:18:10.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Hang in there, Mocha!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.08,0:18:11.20,Default,,0,0,0,,We're on our way!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.90,0:18:14.56,Default,,0,0,0,,That's not very nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.24,0:18:18.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Since the first day they came\Nto live on the island with us,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.46,0:18:23.28,Default,,0,0,0,,We've treated those children with every\Ncomfort and kindness they could ever want.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.34,0:18:26.92,Default,,0,0,0,,And yet you're trying\Nto steal these beloved
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.00,0:18:29.62,Default,,0,0,0,,treasures from their\Nadoring foster parents.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.32,0:18:33.44,Default,,0,0,0,,But I suppose you are pirates.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.08,0:18:36.94,Default,,0,0,0,,If you expect it, then\Nyou must be fine with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.24,0:18:39.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I told you it's not nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.74,0:18:41.32,Default,,0,0,0,,You're done interfering.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.76,0:18:43.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Sword snow!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.66,0:18:47.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Skin sword technique!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.42,0:18:59.54,Default,,0,0,0,,You know, I've noticed that all you've\Nbeen doing is defending yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.62,0:19:03.32,Default,,0,0,0,,So is there some reason why you\Nhaven't tried to attack me at all?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.40,0:19:07.18,Default,,0,0,0,,That's funny at first; I thought\Nthere was no way I could defeat you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.26,0:19:08.52,Default,,0,0,0,,How about that?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.60,0:19:11.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess I was mistaken—there's\Nanother room back here.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.44,0:19:13.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Find the children and get\Nthem out as fast as you can.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.04,0:19:17.20,Default,,0,0,0,,can It feels like a snowstorm in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.44,0:19:18.36,Default,,0,0,0,,The Navy.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.84,0:19:21.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, let's bust the door open.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.42,0:19:25.36,Default,,0,0,0,,It doesn't matter how many of you\Ncome to take those children away.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.44,0:19:26.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll stop you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.96,0:19:28.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Save those kids!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.22,0:19:31.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are all those\Nmarines answering to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.10,0:19:33.14,Default,,0,0,0,,They're not here.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.30,0:19:36.12,Default,,0,0,0,,The only person I can see\Nis pirate hunter Zoro.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.84,0:19:39.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course that pain in the ass is here.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.48,0:19:41.86,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, here's the plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.94,0:19:44.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Everybody make dumb faces at Mosshead!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.12,0:19:52.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I hope they all slip on the ice\Nand crack their stupid skulls open.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.26,0:19:56.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Jackass, Nami and Robin\Nalready went that way.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.06,0:19:59.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Why don't you go chase them down? Gotcha!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.98,0:20:02.39,Default,,0,0,0,,I knew you would be useful to me one day!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.64,0:20:03.92,Default,,0,0,0,,You heard him, boys!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.06,0:20:05.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go find the...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.08,0:20:08.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Never mind, we've got\Na honey right in here!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.66,0:20:12.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Take those tail betters! Oh, come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.38,0:20:14.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Put your jaws up off the floor, morons!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.82,0:20:17.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, just look at her, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.90,0:20:20.22,Default,,0,0,0,,She's half woman, half bird.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.74,0:20:21.74,Default,,0,0,0,,No way.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.08,0:20:24.08,Default,,0,0,0,,A real-life harpy. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.22,0:20:27.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, but hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.20,0:20:30.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Human or not, she sure is a looker, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.02,0:20:32.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Sexiest bird I've ever seen.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.84,0:20:34.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I could be into that.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.42,0:20:35.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Woo-hoo!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.48,0:20:38.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Call me crazy, but I think\Nyou're actually enjoying this.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.58,0:20:42.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, why is it snowing?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.60,0:20:43.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Are we inside?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.82,0:20:45.26,Default,,0,0,0,,It's my duty, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.46,0:20:47.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't care who you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.14,0:20:50.85,Default,,0,0,0,,It'll be a cold day in hell when\NI let you take those children.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.06,0:21:08.20,Default,,0,0,0,,It's my shoulder!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.48,0:21:09.76,Default,,0,0,0,,She bit it off!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.98,0:21:11.24,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll pay for that!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.48,0:21:22.98,Default,,0,0,0,,She's a Nokia-type!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.68,0:21:25.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it, woman.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.26,0:21:35.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Someone is using Haki on me.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.52,0:21:40.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Captain Seagy!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.02,0:21:46.02,Default,,0,0,0,,We sealed off the doors to keep the\Ngas from getting into this room.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.58,0:21:50.99,Default,,0,0,0,,But we don't know that it won't\Nleak in from another spot.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.04,0:21:56.75,Default,,0,0,0,,We don't have much time, so do whatever\Nit takes and rescue all of the children!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.08,0:21:57.91,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.99,0:21:58.98,Default,,0,0,0,,But what about you?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.38,0:22:02.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going to stay right here.
